# OpenSky Network API Credentials
# Register at: https://opensky-network.org/
# These credentials enable access to:
# - Live ADS-B aircraft tracking
# - Aircraft metadata and registration info
# - 7-day flight history
# - Airport information

OPENSKY_USERNAME=your_opensky_username_here
OPENSKY_PASSWORD=your_opensky_password_here

# For local development with Netlify CLI:
# 1. Create a .env file (git-ignored) with your actual credentials
# 2. Run: netlify dev
# 3. Functions will use these variables automatically

# For production on Netlify:
# 1. Go to Site settings > Build & deploy > Environment
# 2. Add these environment variables with your credentials
# 3. Redeploy the site
